## 6. Real-Time Project Architecture

The final project will use Docker Compose to manage three application services.

```text
              User / Browser
                    |
                    v
                Frontend
                Container
                    |
                    v
                 Backend
                Container
                    |
                    v
                 Database
                Container

          Managed using Docker Compose
```

### How It Works

1. The user accesses the application through the frontend.
2. The frontend communicates with the backend.
3. The backend processes application requests.
4. The backend connects to the database when data access is required.
5. Docker Compose defines and manages the services, networks, and volumes.

The exact ports and application technology will be selected during the practical project.

